      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Paint It Black",
      "links": [],
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Trägt nicht alles, was uns begeistert, die Farbe der Nacht?\"\n\nNovalis:\nHymnen an die Nacht",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "/images/nothing/monochrome/black/1882PBilhaud.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "width": "270",
      "height": "175",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Paul Bilhaud: \"Combat de nègres dans un tunnel,\" 1882.\n\n[Black canvas with gold frame; reproduced in Allais (1897)\n\nas \"Combat de nègres dans une cave, pendant la nuit\" .]",
      "links": []
    },
